{
	"info": {
		"name": "rSTAR HRMS API",
		"_postman_id": "b7a1f3c2-5d4e-4a6b-9c8d-0e1f2a3b4c5d",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"description": "HRMS backend API, grouped into folders.\n\nHealth   - liveness and readiness, no auth\nAuth     - login, OTP, refresh, password reset\nAdmin    - Organization and Locations (permission-guarded)\n\nORDER MATTERS the first time through: run Auth top to bottom to capture the token, then Admin > Organization before Admin > Locations, because the location requests read the {{organizationId}} that `create organization` stores.\n\nNo bearer token is ever pasted. verify-otp stores it in {{accessToken}} and every request inherits the collection-level Bearer auth that reads it.\n\nSet {{baseUrl}} in the Variables tab, or pick an environment, and go."
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{accessToken}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
